==Trivia==
*[[Wandering Warriors Cup]] (2022) was an [[Age of Empires II]] S-tier tournament that had Nomad as a beginning map in every series. 
*[[Nomad_Wars/3|Nomad Wars 3]] (2022) was the biggest [[Age of Empires II]] tournament played on Nomad exclusively with a prizepool of $1505, dethroning [[Nomad_Battlegrounds|Nomad Battlegrounds]] which previously held the spot since 2018.
**Similar tournaments are [[Poisn's Nomadness]] (2016), [[Nomad Summer Showdown]] (2019), [[OrnLu's Big Nomad Cup]] (2020), [[Nomad_Wars|Nomad Wars]] (2021), [[Nomad_Warriors|Nomad Warriors]] (2022), all only featuring maps with Nomad start settings.

